    "title": "Shelter-in-place lifted at Seattle's John Muir Elementary School as police search for armed man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Wixey ,\n5 hours ago SEATTLE - A shelter-in-place was lifted at John Muir Elementary School in Seattle as police searched for an armed man possibly in crisis. Seattle Police announced that they were actively looking for a suspect with a firearm near South Walden Street and 33rd Avenue South in the Mount Baker neighborhood at 3 p.m. Thursday. The suspect is known by police and may be in crisis. Read full article\n6",
